BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261221T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261221T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-1@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send her a message today naming one specific thing she 
 did this week that made your life easier. Not 'thanks for everything'. The
  actual thing: 'Thanks for sorting the car insurance. I know that was fort
 y minutes on hold.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Specific thanks shows you were paying
  attention. General thanks sounds like politeness.\n\nDay 1 of 60 · Week 
 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas
 \, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, tal
 k to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 9
 99.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261222T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261222T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-2@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, every time she points something out (a headline
 \, a dog in the street\, a message from a friend) stop and respond properl
 y. Look up\, put the phone face down\, ask one question about it.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Relationship researchers call these 'bids for connection'. In a w
 ell-known study of newlyweds\, couples still together six years later had 
 turned towards each other's small bids far more often than couples who spl
 it.\n\nDay 2 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. 
 Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel u
 nsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling serv
 ice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261223T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261223T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-3@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When you next see her today\, give the first five minut
 es to her\, not to logistics. Greet her properly\, ask how the day went\, 
 listen. Who's picking up whom and what's for tea can wait five minutes.\n
 \nWHY IT WORKS: Reunions set the tone for the evening. A warm one costs no
 thing and is easy to make a habit.\n\nDay 3 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH
  Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy o
 r counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or 
 a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from her list
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261224T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261224T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-4@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find one job that has been sitting on her to-do list (t
 he dentist booking\, the parcel return\, the form for school) and do it\, 
 start to finish\, without being asked. Tell her once it's done\, not befor
 e.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Taking a whole task off someone's plate is worth more 
 than offering to 'help with' it.\n\nDay 4 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH W
 orks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or 
 counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a 
 relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from her list
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261225T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261225T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-5@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Think back to something she mentioned earlier this week
 : a meeting\, a worry\, a friend's news. Ask how it went\, using the detai
 l. 'How did the meeting with Sam go? Did they go for the new rota?'\n\nWHY
  IT WORKS: Remembering the detail tells her that what she says sticks with
  you.\n\nDay 5 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan
 . Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel
  unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling se
 rvice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261226T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261226T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-6@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Make her a drink or a snack exactly the way she likes i
 t\, without asking how she takes it. If you're not sure\, that's today's j
 ob: find out and remember.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Small acts of care done precis
 ely land better than big gestures done generally.\n\nDay 6 of 60 · Week 1
 : Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas
 \, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, tal
 k to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 9
 99.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
