BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261227T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261227T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-7@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find 15 calm minutes today. Ask two questions and only 
 listen: 'What's one thing I did this week that you liked?' and 'What's one
  thing that would make next week easier for you?' Don't defend or explain.
  Say thanks\, and pick one thing to act on.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A short\, reg
 ular check-in keeps small irritations small. It works best when it's routi
 ne\, not only when something's wrong.\n\nDay 7 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\n
 TCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therap
 y or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP 
 or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 8/60: Praise her to someone else
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261228T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261228T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-8@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, say something good about her to someone else: a
  friend\, your parents\, the kids. Even better if she can hear it.\n\nWHY 
 IT WORKS: Hearing yourself praised to other people feels different from a 
 private compliment. It says 'I'm proud of you'\, not just 'thanks'.\n\nDay
  8 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. E
 veryday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel un
 safe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling servi
 ce. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 8/60: Praise her to someone else
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261229T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261229T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-9@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When she shares any good news today\, however small\, r
 espond with real interest: ask questions\, let her tell the whole story\, 
 be pleased out loud. 'Hang on\, tell me exactly what she said.'\n\nWHY IT 
 WORKS: Research on how couples respond to each other's good news found tha
 t enthusiastic\, engaged responses were linked to happier relationships. A
  distracted 'nice' can quietly do the opposite.\n\nDay 9 of 60 · Week 2: 
 Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship
  ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 10/60: A note where she'll find it
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261230T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261230T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-10@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Write one line by hand and leave it where she'll find i
 t tomorrow: the kettle\, the car seat\, a coat pocket\, a lunch box. Make 
 it specific: 'You were brilliant with Dad on Sunday.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A n
 ote keeps working after you've written it. Many people keep them for years
 .\n\nDay 10 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partne
 r Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thing
 s feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counsell
 ing service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 10/60: A note where she'll find it
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
