BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 20/60: An evening to herself
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270109T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270109T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-20@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Arrange an evening this week where she has no responsib
 ilities at all. You handle the house\, the food\, the kids and the tidying
 \, and she chooses what to do: a bath\, friends\, the cinema\, nothing at 
 all. Set it up today. On the night\, don't ring with questions.\n\nWHY IT 
 WORKS: Time that's genuinely free\, not 'free but on call'\, is rare for m
 ost adults with families. It's one of the most valued things you can give.
 \n\nDay 20 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partne
 r Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thing
 s feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counsell
 ing service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
