DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-35@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'What's something you've been thinking about latel
 y that you haven't said out loud?' Give it time. Silence is fine.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Regular check-ins make it safer to bring up bigger things.\n\nDay
  35 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Every
 day relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe
  or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. 
