SUMMARY:Nudge 36/60: Try something new together
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270125T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270125T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-36@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Pick something neither of you has done: a new walk\, a 
 class\, a recipe from a country you've never cooked from\, a different caf
 é. Put it in the diary for this week.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Studies on couples
  doing new and mildly challenging activities together found it boosted how
  satisfied they felt\, more than doing pleasant but familiar things.\n\nDa
 y 36 of 60 · Week 6: Play and try new things\n\nTCH Works · Better Partn
 er Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If thin
 gs feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counsel
 ling service. In an emergency call 999.
