DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find a song from early in your relationship (or from a 
 good holiday) and play it while you're both in the room. See what happens.
 \n\nWHY IT WORKS: Music is a strong memory trigger. It's a cheap way to br
 ing back a good time.\n\nDay 39 of 60 · Week 6: Play and try new things\n
 \nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not ther
 apy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your G
