BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 43/60: Start gently
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270201T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270201T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-43@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: If there's something you need to raise today\, start wi
 th what you feel and what you'd like\, not with what she always does. Inst
 ead of 'You never put anything away'\, try 'I'm feeling swamped by the clu
 tter. Could we do ten minutes tonight together?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: How a di
 fficult conversation starts strongly predicts how it ends. A gentle start 
 makes defensiveness much less likely.\n\nDay 43 of 60 · Week 7: Handle th
 e hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationshi
 p ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelmin
 g\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency
  call 999.
