BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 44/60: Apologise properly for one thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270202T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270202T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-44@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Think of one thing you've done recently that annoyed or
  hurt her. Apologise properly: name it\, say how it might have felt\, say 
 what you'll do differently. No 'but'.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A real apology is s
 pecific and doesn't come with an excuse attached.\n\nDay 44 of 60 · Week 
 7: Handle the hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday
  relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or
  overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In 
 an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
