BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 45/60: Assume the best
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270203T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270203T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-she-2026-12-21-45@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Next time something she does annoys you today\, pause a
 nd think of the most generous explanation before reacting. Tired? Didn't n
 otice? Trying to help?\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Happier couples tend to give each 
 other the benefit of the doubt. It's a habit\, and it can be practised.\n
 \nDay 45 of 60 · Week 7: Handle the hard bits well\n\nTCH Works · Better
  Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. I
 f things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship c
 ounselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
